## Status legend

- **T1** = thesis + conventions (this set) — the anchor
- **T2** = verdict capture (Short) — accept/reject/correct writes to memory automatically; corrections become structural facts, not prose
- **T3** = structural tool layer (Medium) — LSP-backed symbol addressing (never line numbers) + proposal validation at emission
- **T4** = sidecar (Medium) — non-LLM analysis process: categorization, metrics over time, intent interpretation
- **T5** = evaluation layer (Large) — credit assignment, situational routing, mechanism demotion/promotion
- **T6** = playbooks (Medium) — user-defined diagnostic chains, enforced not suggested
- **Stretch** = density chains, retention tiers, summary-drift detection, tool pipelines
